> 
>> Scrolls of enchant weapon are (AFAIK) never
>> part of the monster equipment.
> 
> Exactly.  That's why you never  have more than a
> few of them, unless you polypile (or engage in
> extensive farming, which just generates a ton
> of items in general).

Exactly, "a few of them". I typically find a few of them,
where the actual number is something like 3-12 random
scrolls. (For better understanding of my astonishment I
want to mention that (once identified) I don't even
write those scrolls with magic markers too often. Partly
because markers are rare and I often wish for other items
that seem more necessary, partly because I usually find
enough random scrolls.)

> 
>> But they are generated as [random] death-drops,
> 
